                        ],
                        "form": "speedrun"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "4af7ec77-e0cc-3ff3-8f9e-27c5861e81a5",
                        "entry_id": "9445c8e7-0e7c-3868-a214-873be1544349",
                        "glosses": [
                            "To perform or create a speedrun."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "ambitransitive"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "56cbaee4-add7-4e8c-99b5-956e0da223d4",
                                "sense_id": "4af7ec77-e0cc-3ff3-8f9e-27c5861e81a5",
                                "text": "In my most recent attempt to speedrun this game, I almost managed to beat the world record."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "7c243aef-908b-334f-a384-93fe28033372",
                        "entry_id": "9445c8e7-0e7c-3868-a214-873be1544349",
                        "glosses": [
                            "To do something or undergo some process as quickly as possible."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Internet",
                            "broadly"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "9dcb19c5-261a-4d4b-9fb4-649088ae4085",
                                "sense_id": "7c243aef-908b-334f-a384-93fe28033372",
                                "text": "John decided to speedrun his trip to the grocery store."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "7eaeb907-e6c3-4270-9204-961727853172",
                                "sense_id": "7c243aef-908b-334f-a384-93fe28033372",
                                "text": "Dre said in an interview that he created SCAM to poke fun at other \"shitcoins\" or cryptocurrencies that are clearly pump-and-dump schemes, but at the same time make some money for people willing to put money behind it without any lofty talk to convince people anything more noble is going on. In doing so, SCAM is speedrunning the path of many cryptocurrencies: It hit a $70 million market cap (the snapshot current value of all tokens in circulation) almost immediately after launching, then slumped to $7 million, then $5 million, and now sits at $2.5 million."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a665cf02-cbeb-4bcd-9c59-0274828b9b85",
                                "sense_id": "7c243aef-908b-334f-a384-93fe28033372",
                                "text": "I maintain that the first burrito he ever speedran was the most delicious, was folded with the most care, and had the best ratio of fillings, but burrito speedrunning is not about the flavour, it's about the time."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "81a950c8-d94f-4cf5-8289-5ec76d55523f",
                                "sense_id": "7c243aef-908b-334f-a384-93fe28033372",
                                "text": "While DeSantis' allies have been speedrunning his political vendettas through the legislature, the Yale and Harvard alum embarked on a national tour ostensibly to promote his literary opus entitled The Courage to Be Free: Florida's Blueprint for America's Revival."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "33520c9a-0080-4d65-8a52-bbacaa985d39",
                                "sense_id": "7c243aef-908b-334f-a384-93fe28033372",
                                "text": "The result is an ouroboros of faith and science, where an intentional blurring of lines has created a society where a civilization is speedrunning through its development unaware that there are hands pushing them along."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "0c5bc628-b9de-462f-aa3b-7b739a6285bd",
